  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCLG Grant 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: UCLG Grant 2025-2026 - The Action contributes to the MIP GC &#xbf; priority area 4: partnership with local authorities, SO3: Strengthened local authorities at global level.The main purpose is the continuation of our engagement with the ALAs signatory of Framework Partnership Agreements with the EU as instrument for the implementation of the EU policy on the empowerment of local authorities (LAs) and their associations (ALAs). The support contributes to strengthen the effectiveness of their work as development actors in their own rights, to empower them to exercise their main functions, to improve the capacities of their LA members and their advocacy capacity, and to voice the needs of local communities in regional and global dialogues related to international development agenda/commitments.Strengthening LA will contribute directly to SDG 17 about revitalizing the global partnership for sustainable development as well as SDGs 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 16 in line with LA mandates which cover the fight against poverty, food security, access to health, education, clean water and sanitation, energy, jobs and sustainable growth and infrastructure.This action is also part of the Team Europe on Democracy (TED) through the TED Network Working Group 2 on Political and Civic Participation.</narrative>
  </description>
